# #5851 D5 (a5e2e2ef, #5851 comment 6667620149): a deferred pre-link sibling - its marker
# carries the donor's pending close or an open split token, under the pre-arm gate, with no
# orphan repair - stamps a routed write PreArm and never claims or arms (D1).
MODULE: UnlinkedNeverClaimsDeferredSiblingClaims
TARGET: UnlinkedNeverClaims
CLASS: Invariant
PERTURBS: Claim
SUMMARY: the deferred state's fence admits a claim: an unlinked L whose marker carries the donor's pending close or an open split token claims an epoch no owner replays
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, WithDuplicate = FALSE, WithLatch = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ LatchAdmitsClaim
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a deferred sibling claims.
    /\ LatchAdmitsClaim \/ (~moved /\ (pend \/ hoOpen) /\ ~eagerG /\ ~repair)
--- END
